---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>정밀 인테리어 — 시공 품질관리 매뉴얼</title>
  <meta name="description" content="정밀 인테리어 — 주거·상업·사무 인테리어 시공. 경기 성남시. 현장실측부터 검수까지 공정으로 증명하는 품질관리. 1990년대 제조 QC 매뉴얼 양식." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Saira:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

    :root {
      --paper: #e9ecee;
      --paper-deep: #e0e4e7;
      --paper-edge: #cfd6da;
      --panel: #f4f6f7;
      --panel-line: #c4ccd1;
      --ink: #1d2733;
      --ink-soft: #38444f;
      --ink-faint: #66727c;
      --blue: #1763a6;
      --blue-deep: #114d82;
      --blue-faint: #dce8f2;
      --teal: #1d6b6b;
      --pass: #1d7a4d;
      --warn: #b8531c;
      --seal: #b3402f;
      --hair: #b6bfc5;
      --grid: rgba(29, 39, 51, 0.045);
      --shadow: rgba(29, 39, 51, 0.16);
      --head: 'Archivo', 'Saira', sans-serif;
      --sub: 'Saira', 'Archivo', sans-serif;
      --body: 'IBM Plex Sans KR', 'Archivo', sans-serif;
      --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    }

    html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(0deg, var(--grid) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0 / 100% 28px,
        linear-gradient(90deg, var(--grid) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0 / 28px 100%,
        var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--body);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.75;
      font-size: 15px;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .mono { font-family: var(--mono); }
    .doc { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(14px, 4vw, 40px) 120px; }

    /* ── 공통 문서 머릿단 (ISO header) ───────────── */
    .dochead {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
      background: var(--panel);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 10.5px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
    }
    .dochead > div { padding: 7px 12px; border-right: 1px solid var(--panel-line); }
    .dochead > div:last-child { border-right: none; }
    .dochead .k { display: block; color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .dochead .v { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
    .dochead .iso { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 700; }

    /* ── 섹션 골격 ─────────────────────────────── */
    section { margin-top: 40px; }
    .sec-label {
      display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
      padding-bottom: 8px; margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    .sec-no {
      font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px;
      color: #fff; background: var(--blue);
      padding: 3px 9px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .sec-title { font-family: var(--head); font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(18px, 3vw, 25px); letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.15; }
    .sec-en { font-family: var(--sub); font-weight: 500; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: var(--ink-faint); text-transform: uppercase; margin-left: auto; align-self: center; }

    /* ── 표지 히어로 ──────────────────────────── */
    .cover {
      margin-top: 22px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
      background: var(--panel);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .cover-top {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding: 9px 16px;
      background: var(--ink); color: #cdd7df;
      font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .cover-top .iso { color: #6fb0e6; font-weight: 700; }
    .cover-body { padding: clamp(26px, 6vw, 60px) clamp(18px, 5vw, 56px); position: relative; }
    .cover-grade {
      position: absolute; top: clamp(22px, 5vw, 48px); right: clamp(16px, 5vw, 48px);
      width: clamp(86px, 16vw, 130px); height: clamp(86px, 16vw, 130px);
    }
    .cover-cls { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--blue); font-weight: 700; }
    .cover-name {
      font-family: var(--head); font-weight: 900;
      font-size: clamp(38px, 11vw, 92px); line-height: 0.96; letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin: 10px 0 4px; max-width: 8.5em;
    }
    .cover-sub { font-family: var(--sub); font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(13px, 2.5vw, 19px); letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--blue-deep); }
    .cover-tag { font-size: clamp(13px, 2.4vw, 16px); color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 30em; margin-top: 18px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .cover-meta {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0;
      margin-top: 30px; border: 1px solid var(--panel-line); background: #fff;
    }
    .cover-meta > div { flex: 1 1 140px; padding: 10px 14px; border-right: 1px solid var(--panel-line); }
    .cover-meta > div:last-child { border-right: none; }
    .cover-meta .k { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--ink-faint); text-transform: uppercase; }
    .cover-meta .v { font-family: var(--sub); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink); }

    /* ── 합격 도장 ────────────────────────────── */
    .stamp { display: inline-block; }
    .stamp svg { display: block; }

    /* ── 규격표 (spec tables) ─────────────────── */
    .spec-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
    .spec-card { border: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--panel); }
    .spec-card h3 {
      margin: 0; padding: 9px 14px;
      background: var(--blue); color: #fff;
      font-family: var(--head); font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    }
    .spec-card h3 .code { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.85; }
    .spec-card table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12.5px; }
    .spec-card td { padding: 6px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-line); vertical-align: top; }
    .spec-card tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .spec-card td.lab { color: var(--ink-faint); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.03em; width: 38%; }
    .spec-card td.val { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }

    /* ── 플로우차트 / 관리도 캔버스 ───────────── */
    .figure {
      border: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--panel);
      padding: 18px; overflow-x: auto;
    }
    .figure-cap {
      font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--ink-faint); text-transform: uppercase;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--hair); padding-bottom: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .figure svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 100%; }

    /* ── 검사 체크리스트 ──────────────────────── */
    .qc-wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr; gap: 16px; align-items: start; }
    .checklist { border: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--panel); }
    .checklist .ch-head {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 9px 14px; background: var(--ink); color: #cdd7df;
      font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .checklist ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 4px 0; }
    .checklist li {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 26px 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      padding: 8px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-line); font-size: 13px;
    }
    .checklist li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .checklist .box {
      width: 18px; height: 18px; border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); background: #fff;
      display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--pass);
    }
    .checklist .box svg { width: 13px; height: 13px; display: block; }
    .checklist .res { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--pass); font-weight: 600; }
    .checklist .lab { color: var(--ink); }
    .checklist .lab small { display: block; color: var(--ink-faint); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }

    /* ── 단가표 ───────────────────────────────── */
    .price-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); background: var(--panel); font-size: 13.5px; }
    .price-table thead th {
      background: var(--ink); color: #e3eaef; text-align: left;
      font-family: var(--sub); font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      padding: 10px 14px;
    }
    .price-table thead th.num { text-align: right; font-family: var(--mono); }
    .price-table td { padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-line); }
    .price-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #fff; }
    .price-table td.num { text-align: right; font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 600; color: var(--blue-deep); }
    .price-table td.item { font-weight: 600; }
    .price-table td.item small { display: block; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 11px; }
    .price-note { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); margin-top: 8px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }

    /* ── 개정이력 ─────────────────────────────── */
    .rev-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; border: 1px solid var(--hair); background: var(--panel); }
    .rev-table th { text-align: left; padding: 7px 12px; background: var(--paper-deep); color: var(--ink-soft); letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-weight: 600; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair); }
    .rev-table td { padding: 7px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-line); color: var(--ink-soft); }
    .rev-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

    /* ── CTA / 연락 ───────────────────────────── */
    .cta {
      margin-top: 44px; border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); background: var(--panel);
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    }
    .cta-l { padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px); border-right: 1.5px solid var(--ink); }
    .cta-l h2 { font-family: var(--head); font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(22px, 4vw, 34px); margin: 8px 0 12px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    .cta-l p { color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0 0 22px; max-width: 26em; }
    .cta-btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      background: var(--blue); color: #fff; text-decoration: none;
      font-family: var(--sub); font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      padding: 13px 26px; border: 1.5px solid var(--blue-deep);
      transition: background .15s ease, transform .15s ease;
    }
    .cta-btn:hover { background: var(--blue-deep); transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .cta-r { padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px); background: #fff; }
    .contact-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 9px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-line); }
    .contact-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .contact-row .k { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--ink-faint); text-transform: uppercase; width: 84px; flex: none; padding-top: 3px; }
    .contact-row .v { font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); }
    .contact-row .v small { display: block; color: var(--ink-faint); font-weight: 400; font-size: 12px; }

    /* ── 본문 푸터 ────────────────────────────── */
    .footer {
      margin-top: 28px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hair);
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;
      font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink-faint);
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 56em; margin: 0 0 22px;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--blue); padding-left: 16px; line-height: 1.8;
    }

    /* ── 반응형 ───────────────────────────────── */
    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .dochead { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .dochead > div:nth-child(1) { grid-column: 1 / -1; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-line); }
      .spec-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .qc-wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cta-l { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--ink); }
      .cover-grade { position: static; margin: 0 0 16px; }
      .sec-en { display: none; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .dochead { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .dochead > div { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-line); }
      .dochead > div:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
      .cover-meta > div { flex: 1 1 100%; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-line); }
      .cover-meta > div:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
    <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
    <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 10 · 정밀 인테리어 — 1990년대 제조 품질관리(QC) 매뉴얼 스타일</span>
    <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
  </div>
  <div style="height:40px;"></div>

  <div class="doc">

    <!-- 공통 ISO 머릿단 -->
    <div class="dochead">
      <div>
        <span class="k">Document Title</span>
        <span class="v">시공 품질관리 매뉴얼 · CONSTRUCTION QUALITY MANUAL</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="k">Document No.</span>
        <span class="v">DOC. QM-1993</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="k">Conforms To</span>
        <span class="iso">ISO 9001 : 1994</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ① 매뉴얼 표지식 히어로 -->
    <div class="cover">
      <div class="cover-top">
        <span>FILE / QM-1993 · REV. 4.2 · CONTROLLED COPY №<span class="iso">017</span></span>
        <span>ISSUED <span class="iso">1993-03-02</span> · UPDATED 2026-06</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cover-body">
        <div class="stamp cover-grade" aria-label="합격 도장">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 130 130" role="img">
            <circle cx="65" cy="65" r="60" fill="none" stroke="#b3402f" stroke-width="3"/>
            <circle cx="65" cy="65" r="50" fill="none" stroke="#b3402f" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="65" y="50" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Archivo, sans-serif" font-size="28" font-weight="900" fill="#b3402f" letter-spacing="2">PASS</text>
            <text x="65" y="70" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="10" fill="#b3402f" letter-spacing="3">QC APPROVED</text>
            <text x="65" y="86" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" fill="#b3402f" letter-spacing="1">검수 합격 / 정밀</text>
            <path d="M28 100 H102" stroke="#b3402f" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            <text x="65" y="112" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" fill="#b3402f" letter-spacing="1.5">INSP-2026-0627</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="cover-cls">CLASS A · 종합 인테리어 시공 / FIT-OUT</div>
        <h1 class="cover-name">정밀<br/>인테리어</h1>
        <div class="cover-sub">JEONGMIL INTERIOR — Precision Fit-out Works</div>
        <p class="cover-tag">시공을 감(感)이 아니라 공정(工程)으로 증명합니다. 현장실측부터 검수까지 28개 검사 항목, 관리한계선 안의 품질로 납품합니다.</p>
        <div class="cover-meta">
          <div><div class="k">Scope</div><div class="v">주거 · 상업 · 사무</div></div>
          <div><div class="k">Region</div><div class="v">경기 성남시 일원</div></div>
          <div><div class="k">Defect Rate</div><div class="v">0.8% (12M)</div></div>
          <div><div class="k">Lead Time</div><div class="v">실측 후 D+3 견적</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ② 시공 범위 — 규격표 -->
    <section id="scope">
      <div class="sec-label">
        <span class="sec-no">§ 2.0</span>
        <span class="sec-title">시공 범위 규격</span>
        <span class="sec-en">Scope of Supply</span>
      </div>
      <p class="lead">현장 용도별로 적용 규격·자재 등급·보증 기준을 분리 관리합니다. 모든 시공은 아래 규격표에 명시된 공차(Tolerance) 안에서 수행되며, 항목별 검사 성적서가 발행됩니다.</p>
      <div class="spec-grid">

        <div class="spec-card">
          <h3>주거 RESIDENTIAL <span class="code">SPC-R</span></h3>
          <table>
            <tr><td class="lab">적용 대상</td><td class="val">아파트 · 빌라 · 단독주택</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="lab">주요 공정</td><td class="val">철거 · 목공 · 도배 · 바닥 · 욕실</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="lab">자재 등급</td><td class="val">친환경 E0 / SE0 등급</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="lab">수평 공차</td><td class="val">± 2 mm / 3 m</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="lab">하자보증</td><td class="val">시공일 기준 2 년</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="lab">표준 공기</td><td class="val">25 평 기준 14 일</td></tr>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="spec-card">
          <h3>상업 COMMERCIAL <span class="code">SPC-C</span></h3>
          <table>
            <tr><td class="lab">적용 대상</td><td class="val">카페 · 음식점 · 매장</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="lab">주요 공정</td><td class="val">설비 · 전기증설 · 주방 · 사인</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="lab">자재 등급</td><td class="val">불연 · 준불연 인증재</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="lab">전기 용량</td><td class="val">증설 단상/삼상 협의</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="lab">하자보증</td><td class="val">시공일 기준 1.5 년</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="lab">표준 공기</td><td class="val">20 평 기준 18 일</td></tr>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="spec-card">
          <h3>사무 OFFICE <span class="code">SPC-O</span></h3>
          <table>
            <tr><td class="lab">적용 대상</td><td class="val">사무실 · 클리닉 · 스튜디오</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="lab">주요 공정</td><td class="val">파티션 · 시스템천장 · 네트워크</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="lab">자재 등급</td><td class="val">KS 인증 시스템 가구</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="lab">차음 성능</td><td class="val">회의실 35 dB 이상</td></tr>
